                                                "sense_id": "31088c0d-2a2e-3c5f-9ea3-42148507cbb7",
                                                "text": "Temple & his Brother & I dined in their chambers where we had dinner brought thinking it a more genteel & agreable way than in a Chophouse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae97e79f-ef9e-4982-8a76-4ac58f313750",
                                                "sense_id": "31088c0d-2a2e-3c5f-9ea3-42148507cbb7",
                                                "text": "But franchisers don't sell many of their thirty-three billion hamburgers per year in blue highway towns where chophouses must draw customers through continuing quality rather than national advertising."
                                            }
